The e2e test was checking for the default Next.js title "Create Next App" but the metadata was updated to "Simul" in `layout.tsx`.

### Changes
- Updated `__tests__/e2e/home.spec.ts` to expect "Simul" title to match the metadata in `src/app/layout.tsx`

```typescript
// Before
await expect(page).toHaveTitle("Create Next App");

// After
await expect(page).toHaveTitle("Simul");
```

